# Kernel slots a SIMD level leaves on the scalar function (scripts/check-kernels.py). family, level, slot ([] = every element of an array slot), reason (tab separated).
# A reason is a measurement or a property of the operation.
agg	avx2	count_gid	scatter-add of rows into per-group accumulators: the lanes of a vector can meet in one group, so a vector form pays only below about 4 groups; under 0.5% of the cycles of the 156-statement corpus (perf record, 2026-10-26)
agg	avx2	sum_gid_f64	scatter-add of rows into per-group accumulators: the lanes of a vector can meet in one group, so a vector form pays only below about 4 groups; under 0.5% of the cycles of the 156-statement corpus (perf record, 2026-10-26)
